function renderStats(){if(intelMode==="compare")intelMode="confidence";var live=activeBars(),list=sortedByCrowd(live),shortest=[...live].sort((a,b)=>a.wait-b.wait)[0],top=list[0],activeCovers=live.filter(b=>coverLabel(b)).length,body=intelMode==="tonight"?renderIntelTonight(top,shortest,activeCovers):intelMode==="timing"?renderIntelTiming():renderIntelConfidence();$("#statsPage").innerHTML=`<div class="sectionlabel">NIGHT INTEL</div><div class="seg intelTabs"><button class="${intelMode==="tonight"?"on":""}" onclick="intelMode='tonight';renderStats()">Tonight</button><button class="${intelMode==="timing"?"on":""}" onclick="intelMode='timing';renderStats()">Timing</button><button class="${intelMode==="confidence"?"on":""}" onclick="intelMode='confidence';renderStats()">Signals</button></div><div class="intelBody">${body}<div class="card intelNote"><b>Why this exists</b><p class="muted intelCopy">Intel answers timing, confidence, and value questions without making users reread the live bar list.</p></div></div>`}
